Subject: [PATCH 25/26] Android Auto: Support Android Auto as user app 1/2

[a17: Android 17 removed PermissionManagerServiceImpl. The package/signature/
permission list moves to com.android.server.pm.AndroidAutoPackage and the
grant is checked in the Kotlin PermissionService.isPermissionGranted(), which
both checkPermission() and checkUidPermission() go through. config.xml part
unchanged.]

(cherry picked from commit fe1f4a825e9a851fd179bd283aba2b0e552bc02f)

